---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { pathFor } from '../../i18n/ui';

const locale = 'en' as const;
const title = 'AI consulting and production';
const description = 'AI consulting and training on evidence, not hype. Intelligence, our platform where you watch AI work. Western and Chinese models, benchmarked.';
---

<Layout locale={locale} route="ai-services" title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="hero-editorial hero-editorial--dark ai-hero">
    <div class="container" data-reveal>
      <h1 class="hero-editorial__title balance">AI, applied. Not admired.</h1>
      <p class="hero-editorial__lead">
        Built for companies that want AI earning its keep, from mid-size teams to groups selling across
        beauty, automotive, food and beverage, and industrial goods.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-editorial__lead ai-hero__second">
        Three teams and one platform, sharing one stance: evidence over hype. We measure before we
        recommend. We benchmark Western and Chinese models side by side, then put the result into
        production on your data. And we run <a href={pathFor('products', locale)}>our own products</a> on
        this same stack, in public.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt" id="stance">
    <div class="container container--narrow" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="balance">Both sides of the wall.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        The AI world split in two, one ecosystem on each side of China's Great Firewall. Most consultancies
        know the Western stack. Few know the Chinese one. The models on each side are built and priced
        differently, and they answer to different rules. The right choice depends on your data and your
        markets. We benchmark GPT and Claude against Qwen and DeepSeek on the actual task, then recommend
        on the merits, not on which side we happen to know. Data residency is part of the answer, not an
        afterthought.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="teams">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-header" data-reveal>
        <h2 class="balance">Three teams. One platform.</h2>
      </header>

      <div class="grid-2 ai-brand-grid">
        <div class="ai-brand-bezel" data-reveal>
          <a class="card ai-brand-card ai-brand-card--platform" href={pathFor('ai-services/intelligence', locale)}>
            <span class="ai-brand-card__tag">The platform</span>
            <span class="ai-brand-card__name">
              <img class="ai-brand-card__icon" src="/AgencyLogos/intelligence-icon.png" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              Intelligence
            </span>
            <h3>See AI at work before you commit.</h3>
            <p>
              Our platform, and the fastest way to see what we mean by evidence. Working AI modules, real
              tasks, every cost on screen. Three functions ready today.
            </p>
            <span class="pill-cta" style="margin-top: auto;">Discover Intelligence
              <span class="pill-cta__disc" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="14" height="14"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="13 6 19 12 13 18"/></svg></span>
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="card ai-brand-card" data-reveal style="--ri: 1">
          <span class="ai-brand-card__tag">Consulting</span>
          <img class="ai-brand-card__logo" src="/AgencyLogos/BearingBridgeAI-horizontal.svg" alt="BearingBridge AI" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <h3>Consulting and implementation.</h3>
          <p>
            Strategy through adoption, plus training for leadership and builders, on dated baselines and
            metrics agreed in writing before anyone builds. Our AZIMUTH method works like navigation: take
            a bearing, prove it, then scale. When the evidence says stop, we say stop.
          </p>
          <a class="ai-brand-card__method" href="https://www.bearingbridge.ai/method" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">See the method ↗</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" style="margin-top: auto;" href="https://www.bearingbridge.ai" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">bearingbridge.ai ↗</a>
        </div>

        <a class="card ai-brand-card" href="https://hubstudio.ai" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-reveal style="--ri: 2">
          <span class="ai-brand-card__tag">Production</span>
          <img class="ai-brand-card__logo" src="/AgencyLogos/hubStudio%20(2).png" alt="HubStudio" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <h3>Content production at scale.</h3>
          <p>
            Half studio, half AI lab. Images, video, and the words around them, produced at volume without
            losing the brand's voice.
          </p>
          <span class="btn btn--ghost" style="margin-top: auto;">hubstudio.ai ↗</span>
        </a>

        <a class="card ai-brand-card" href="https://nuvora.studio" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-reveal style="--ri: 3">
          <span class="ai-brand-card__tag">B2B pipeline</span>
          <img class="ai-brand-card__logo" src="/AgencyLogos/Nuvora%20PNG.png" alt="Nuvora Studio" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <h3>LinkedIn-only B2B.</h3>
          <p>
            Strategy, content, ads. One channel, done properly, run on an AI-driven engine, so a real
            pipeline comes out the other end.
          </p>
          <span class="btn btn--ghost" style="margin-top: auto;">nuvora.studio ↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tight section--alt">
    <div class="container container--narrow center" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="balance">Talk to us about AI.</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-inline: auto;">
        A conversation with the senior team about your markets, your data, and where AI would actually pay
        back for you. Engagements start small: a scoped pilot with a dated baseline and a written price.
        And if the honest answer is that AI is not your next move, we will say so.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content: center; margin-top: var(--space-5);">
        <a class="pill-cta" href={pathFor('contact', locale)}>Book a call
          <span class="pill-cta__disc" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="14" height="14"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="13 6 19 12 13 18"/></svg></span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="ai-cta__email">Prefer email? <a href="mailto:hello@bearingbridge.com">hello@bearingbridge.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .ai-hero .hero-editorial__lead { max-width: 62ch; }
  .ai-hero__second { margin-top: var(--space-3); }
  .ai-hero__second a {
    color: inherit;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .ai-brand-grid {
    align-items: stretch;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }
  @media (max-width: 799px) {
    .ai-brand-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .ai-brand-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }
  .card.ai-brand-card {
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 18px;
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px rgba(10, 20, 30, 0.06),
      0 20px 40px -30px rgba(10, 20, 30, 0.3);
    transition:
      transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1),
      box-shadow 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1);
  }
  .card.ai-brand-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px rgba(10, 20, 30, 0.06),
      0 26px 52px -30px rgba(10, 20, 30, 0.35);
  }
  .ai-brand-bezel {
    display: flex;
    padding: 6px;
    border-radius: 25px;
    background: rgba(10, 20, 30, 0.04);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(10, 20, 30, 0.05);
  }
  .ai-brand-bezel .card.ai-brand-card--platform {
    flex: 1;
    border-radius: 19px;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 50px -32px rgba(10, 20, 30, 0.55);
  }
  .ai-brand-bezel .card.ai-brand-card--platform:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 56px -32px rgba(10, 20, 30, 0.6);
  }
  .ai-brand-card__tag {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--bbg-blue);
  }
  .ai-brand-card__name {
    font-family: var(--font-display, inherit);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--bbg-ink);
    line-height: 1;
    height: 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .ai-brand-card__icon {
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #fff;
    padding: 2px;
  }
  .ai-brand-card__logo {
    height: 48px;
    width: auto;
    max-width: 240px;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: left center;
    display: block;
  }
  .ai-brand-card h3 { margin: 0; }
  .ai-brand-card p { margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); }
  .ai-brand-card__method {
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--bbg-blue);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    width: fit-content;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .ai-brand-card__method:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .ai-brand-card--platform {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #131d33 0%, #1f2e4d 100%);
    border-color: transparent;
  }
  .ai-brand-card--platform .ai-brand-card__tag { color: #e0b35e; }
  .ai-brand-card--platform .ai-brand-card__name,
  .ai-brand-card--platform h3 { color: #fff; }
  .ai-brand-card--platform p { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78); }

  .ai-cta__email {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    color: var(--bbg-text-muted);
  }
  .ai-cta__email a {
    color: var(--bbg-blue);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .ai-cta__email a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
